Using Mike's drawing and doing the math, the "pot" or knob value should be 50K
The Bally uses  either a 50K or 100k pots. If it is a 50 K, it will have a wire coming out of one side (probably the brown one) and the other coming out of the middle.
The 100K pots will have a jumper from one outside pin to the other outside pin.

Either of these will work for your needs.

Ken

