archived.  While I've added them to the Ballyalley.com, I've actually not 

used any that I've added in the past year or so.  I couldn't really use 

BASIC to load programs because plugging and unplugging the audio cable 

caused the computer to reset.  Not anymore.



Now I'm just crossing my fingers that this machine doesn't go off and die on 

me.



Adam



